1
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,960
菲尔 亲爱的怎么还不睡
Oh Phil, honey you're still up.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,880
你听听这样如何
Ok. How's this sound?

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,760
米奇尔 我很爱很爱你
Mitchell, I love you very much,

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,480
我不光爱你 更钦佩你
not only love you but I admire you

5
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,180
有朝一日我愿...
and someday I hope to...

6
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,960
你是在炒鱿鱼还是表白啊
Are you firing him or proposing to him?

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,460
亲爱的 那本来就只是份兼职
Honey, this was supposed to be a part-time job.

8
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,240
何况他原本也只打算干到夏天
He was gonna be done in the summer anyway.

9
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,840
-直接说就好了 -之前应该给他提个醒的
- Just be direct. - I should have warned him.

10
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,640
可叫我怎么开口
How do you tell someone

11
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,240
指出他懒名远扬呢
they have a reputation for being lazy?

12
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,720
米奇尔 懒?
Mitchell? Lazy?

13
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,400
没错 好几份合同他都迟迟才交
Yeah. Yeah. He handed in a couple of contracts late,

14
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,720
我又不好对此说三道四
but I didn't want to say anything

15
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,440
因为他基本算是在义务劳动了
because he's practically doing this for free.

16
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,540
我办不来
I can't do this!

17
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,640
我就不是做冷血杀手的料
This isn't the face of a cold-blooded hatchet man.

18
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,580
要不你来
Will you do it?

19
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,040
抱歉 我们把你吵醒了吗
Oh, I'm sorry. Did we wake you up?

20
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:41,792
不 一直就没睡
No, I was up.

21
00:00:41,947 --> 00:00:43,160
为明天的事犯愁呢
I'm worried about tomorrow.

22
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,140
我的美术老师一直对我熟视无睹
My art teacher acts like I don't exist,

23
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,480
不过我还有最后一次机会
but I have one last chance

24
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,840
在期末美术展上一鸣惊人
to impress him at our year-end art fair.

25
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,700
我选了这幅 我们一家老小齐上阵
I've chosen this one, and I'm using my own family.

26
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,720
有才吧
Brilliant, right?

27
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,400
当我告诉他时他说 "不错啊爱丽丝"
When I told him, he said, "That's nice, Alice."

28
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:59,100
都上了一年课了
It's been a year.

29
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,160
爱丽丝 名字都叫错
Alice? Really?

30
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,000
宝贝 你这么紧张
Honey, do you think you're nervous

31
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,860
是因为你其实有点暗恋贾维斯老师吗
because you've got a little crush on Mr. Jarvis?

32
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:05,980
-才不是 -确定吗
- No. - Are you sure?

33
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:06,740
你瞅他那眼神我可见识过
Because I've seen the way you look at him--

34
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:08,905
我看有点暗恋他的人是你吧
Sounds like you're the one with the crush! Mm.

35
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:11,060
我只是从没碰见过不喜欢我的老师
I've just never had a teacher not like me before.

36
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,600
戴维斯老师对你不咋地
Well, Ms. Davis. Mm.

37
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,980
拜托 她是教体育的好不好
Please. She's a gym teacher.

38
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,340
她的执教能力就和瑟斯博士的医疗知识一样
She is to teaching what Dr. Seuss is to medicine.

39
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:18,464
怪不得她看你不顺眼
And to think she didn't like you.

40
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,120
那位 你怎么也没睡
You? What's your problem?

41
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,580
没事 就是对明天有点小兴奋
Nothing. I'm just excited for tomorrow.

42
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,980
学校要为我颁发奖牌
I'm getting a medal at school

43
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:26,244
因为我扑灭了一场火
because I put out a fire.

44
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,560
也许我长大后可以往这方面发展发展
Maybe that's what I should be when I grow up...

45
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,980
获奖专业户
A professional medal-getter.

46
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,060
卢克 出什么事了
Luke, what happened?

47
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:37,520
我不知道
I don't know.

48
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:40,840
我刚才路过时闻到了烟味而已
I was just walking by and I smelled flames.

49
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,400
案发当时我也在现场
I was there.

50
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:43,880
你别瞎搞
I don't like this.

51
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:45,060
我们压根就不该来这儿
We're not supposed to be in here.

52
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,020
你专心点帮我望风
Just keep a lookout!

53
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:48,752
再过十秒 "卢克元素"就要问世了
We're ten seconds away from creating Luketonium.

54
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,480
-糟了 -看看你做的好事
- Oh, crap! - Look what you did!

55
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:55,140
卢克 出什么事了
Luke, what happened?

56
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,580
我不知道
I don't know.

57
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,940
我刚才路过时闻到了烟味而已
I was just walking by and I smelled flames.

58
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,840
好了 各位 再不上床睡觉
Okay, guys, you're gonna be dragging tomorrow

59
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,460
明天都该爬不起床了 去睡吧
if you don't go to bed right now. Let's go. Go.

60
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,880
好 走吧 爱丽丝
Fine. Come on, Alice.

61
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,720
我一会儿就上楼睡
I'll be up in a minute.

62
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:13,820
"米奇尔
"Mitchell,

63
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,340
有一件事我实在开不了口
I can't tell you how hard...

64
00:02:16,771 --> 00:02:17,916
开不了口"
How hard this..."

65
00:02:17,916 --> 00:02:20,774
不 这样显得太生疏
No, that's-- no, it's not personal enough.

66
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,860
够了 够了
Okay, okay.

67
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,980
"我对你真是失望透顶 愤怒至极
"I can't tell you how hurt and angry this makes me,

68
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,740
一而再再而三的不遵守时间
but you've been late too many times.

69
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,960
请把钥匙还给我吧"
I'll need your keys."

70
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,660
爸爸 别这样 我错了
Daddy, no! I'm so sorry!

71
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,600
宝贝 我怎么没听见你下楼的声音
Honey, I didn't hear you come downstairs.

72
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:38,780
你今晚也睡不着是吧
You couldn't sleep, either?

73
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,520
是的
Uh, yeah.

74
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:45,840
我满脑子都在想毕业典礼的事
No, there's just, like, a lot on my mind with graduation,

75
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:48,900
该穿什么去呢 这套怎么样
and what to wear. How does this look?

76
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:51,220
等一下 你手上拎着鞋呢
Wait a second. You're carrying your shoes.

77
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,420
你得穿个全套我才好评价啊
How am I supposed to judge the whole outfit?

78
00:02:54,420 --> 00:02:55,361
把鞋穿上
Put 'em on.

79
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:11,260
请你务必认真仔细地
So make sure you give this menu here

80
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,500
读一读这份菜单
a good, thorough reading.

81
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,940
-要份汤 -你根本看都没看
- Soup. - You didn't even look at it.

82
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:18,160
-还是汤 -仔细看看汤一栏下面的
- Soup. - Check out what's below the soup--

83
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,100
三明治
Sandwiches.

84
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:21,960
你有仔细看看我这裙内的风光吗
Have you check out what is below this outfit?

85
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,720
可不是靠吃三明治吃出来的
This doesn't come from sandwiches.

86
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:24,380
瞧啊
Look!

87
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:27,561
"杰·普里契特"
"The Jay Pritchett"?

88
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,860
我给弄糊涂了
I don't understand.

89
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,060
你这名字取自一种三明治吗
They named you after a sandwich?

90
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:33,240
不对 这三明治是以我命名的
No! They named a sandwich after me!

91
00:03:33,261 --> 00:03:35,637
火鸡肉 腌肉 瑞士奶酪
"Turkey, bacon, swiss cheese,

92
00:03:35,637 --> 00:03:37,487
红辣椒 凤尾鱼 全麦面包
red peppers, anchovies on wheat"?

93
00:03:37,487 --> 00:03:39,390
一般人加到咸腌肉就差不多了
Most people would stop after the salty bacon,

94
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,240
可我这宝贝里凤尾鱼都是双层
But I double down with the anchovies.

95
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,440
你是做三明治呢 还是配猎鹿的诱饵呢
Were you making a sandwich or attracting deer?

96
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:45,260
老无赖骚扰你了吗 小姐
Is this bum bothering you, miss?

97
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,600
我真该把这一幕照下来留念
Oh, I should get a picture of this--

98
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:48,620
这破地方居然还有个女招待
An actual waitress sighting in this dump.

99
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,740
我本指望靠你那三明治来招揽生意
I took a chance and put in an order for your sandwich,

100
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:55,084
结果多数人更愿意"杰·普里契特"打包[走人]
although most people like their Jay Pritchetts to go.

101
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,040
这是唱的哪一出啊
What's happening?

102
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:57,560
歌洛莉亚 来见过玛克辛
Gloria, it's Maxine.

103
00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:59,020
你就是下嫁杰的那位
So you're married to Jay.

104
00:03:59,041 --> 00:04:01,527
你把你的导盲犬拴在哪里了
Where'd you tie up your seeing eye dog?

105
00:04:01,527 --> 00:04:03,261
不 不是 我没有瞎
No, no, I'm not, um...

106
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:06,040
好吧 我听懂了 听懂了
Okay, I get it. I get it.

107
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:08,580
那颈部医生的电话 我一直推荐你去看的那个
Here's that number for that neck doctor I want you to see.

108
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,060
-谢了 -你脖子怎么了
- Thanks. - What's wrong with your neck?

109
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:12,820
三十年了 他总说这是玩手球时受的伤
For 30 years, I've been hearing it's a handball injury.

110
00:04:12,820 --> 00:04:15,040
不过每次压力一大 病就加重
But it always seems to get worse with stress.

111
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,280
我估计是给最近那审计闹的
Maybe it's that audit he's got coming up.

112
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:18,742
-审计 -没多大事
- Audit? - It's nothing.

113
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:21,640
真贴心 他不想让你操心
Oh, isn't that cute? He doesn't want you to worry.

114
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:23,680
你的三明治来了
Here's your sandwich.

115
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,480
现在轮到你操心了
Now you should worry.

116
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:27,640
瞧瞧 我视如己出的宝贝
Look at it-- my prettiest child.

117
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:29,880
你怎么不告诉我脖子的事呢
Why didn't you tell me about your neck?

118
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,520
没啥大事 尝一口
It's fine. Take a bite.

119
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,340
-你们公司要被审计吗 -没事
- Your company's getting audited? - Nothing!

120
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,680
熬三天就过去了
Three bad days, then it's over.

121
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,620
开吃吧 我急着等你的评价呢
Come on! I'm--I'm anxious to hear what you think.

122
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,279
尝出点滋味了吧
I see it growing on ya.

123
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:42,260
跟玛克辛第一次尝它时一样
It's like Maxine when she first tried it.

124
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,422
-你知道她也 -我不喜欢这玩意儿
- You know, she-- - I don't like it.

125
00:04:43,564 --> 00:04:44,556
你还没全吃完呢
You probably didn't get all--

126
00:04:44,556 --> 00:04:46,294
杰 我吃过了 不喜欢
Jay, I try it. I don't like it.

127
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,860
这就是你的评价吗
That's all you can say?

128
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:49,680
这玩意儿味道差极了
It tastes bad in my mouth.

129
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,660
就像一条鱼和一只火鸡
It's like a fish and a turkey

130
00:04:51,660 --> 00:04:53,740
用胡椒做武器斗个你死我活
beat themselves to death with a pepper.

131
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,460
你尽管说 虽说有点吹毛求疵
Okay, fair enough. Maybe a little picky, though,

132
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,380
可每次你做完哥伦比亚特色菜
from someone who prepared a colombian specialty

133
00:04:58,380 --> 00:05:00,400
不也会反问我 "你怎么不尝一口蹄子
and said, "Why are you not eating the hooves?

134
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,660
那可都是精华啊"
They're the best part."

135
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,560
我回来了
I'm back!

136
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,000
小卡舅夫你回来了
Oh, hey, uncle Cam.

137
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:09,249
谢谢你那天晚上来接我
Oh, thanks again for picking me up last night.

138
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:11,320
小意思 不过你得更加小心才是
You're welcome, but you have to be more careful.

139
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:13,060
我才是负责任的那个
I was the responsible one.

140
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,660
丽萨喝多了 我收了她的车钥匙
Lisa was drinking, and I took her keys,

141
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:16,580
-然后 -我明白
- and then e-- - I understand.

142
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,920
舅夫高三那会儿也有过疯狂之夜
My senior year, I had a pretty crazy night myself

143
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,320
俺们农场那些碎玉米啊翻犁头什么的
involving a bottle of corn mash and an overturned plow.

144
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:23,900
-不是吧 -你是没见过当时那阵仗
- Seriously? - Yeah. You don't know terror until you've had to

145
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,420
我直视着密苏里州骑警的双眼
stare down the eyes of a Missouri State trooper

146
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,840
为自己酒后扰乱治安辩解
and talk your way out of a P.U.I.

147
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,300
亲爱的你又不喝咖啡的
Honey, you don't drink coffee.

148
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:32,880
我昨晚大半夜都没睡踏实
I do when I've been up half the night

149
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,560
担心我那只完工了三分之一的作业
worrying about a project that's only one-third done,

150
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:36,640
还有一条围裙要缝 一副风景画要画
and I still have an apron to sew, scenery to paint,

151
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,890
再加上工作表全乱套了 所以...
plus my normal crushing workload. So...

152
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,020
除非你有个更好的办法帮我提神
Unless you have a better way for me to stimula--

153
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:42,458
哦天呐
Oh, god.

154
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,580
老天 咖啡真苦
God, coffee's bitter.

155
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:45,960
你这是第一次喝吗
That was your first sip?

156
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:48,360
好了 我拿来了砂锅
Okay, I got the chafing dish,

157
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:50,840
盐罐和胡椒罐 黄金搭档
salt and pepper shakers-- perfect matches, both.

158
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,280
我得把葡萄重新摆放一下
I may have to readjust my grapes.

159
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:56,630
是吗 那我还是回避一下吧
Oh. Ow. I'll just give you a little privacy.

160
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:59,880
"灯光秀"又回来了
Welcome back to the light show. Hi.

161
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,000
嗨 莉莉
Hi, lily.

162
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,160
嗨 爹地
Hi, daddy.

163
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,300
莉莉
Lily...

164
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:05,900
亲爱的 不行
Sweetheart, no.

165
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:08,666
不行 不行 今天不能这么玩
No, no, no, no. We're-- we're not gonna do that today.

166
00:06:08,666 --> 00:06:09,360
等一下 克莱尔 实际上
Actually-- actually, Claire,

167
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,720
我们正在尽量不对女儿说"不"字
We're--we're trying not to use the word "No" So much.

168
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:13,040
我们刚读过的一本书上说
We just read a book that said

169
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:15,040
孩子们会从"不"字学会叛逆
children learn to rebel against that word.

170
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:18,060
所以我们要换种活动去诱导她
So we redirect her into a new activity instead.

171
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:20,060
看好了
Oh. Here--well, just watch this.

172
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:22,640
乖女儿 爹地在这儿
Lily, sweetie, hi. It's daddy here.

173
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:24,320
你想听点音乐吗
Would you like to listen to some music?

174
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:26,600
好的 听吧
Okay. There you go.

175
00:06:27,060 --> 00:06:27,480
瞧
See?

176
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:29,580
每一代人都觉得
Every new generation thinks

177
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:31,420
自己掌握了教育孩子的秘诀
they have cracked the code on child rearing.

178
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,600
最新的秘诀 就是不要说"不"
What's the latest theory? Never say "No."

179
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,240
"不"就是老娘每天在家里的口头禅
I say "No" Every day in this house.

180
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,200
可夜半回床上 她就忍不住狂喊"真爽"[是]
But at night, she's a "Yes" Machine.

181
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:38,760
没有
No.

182
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:44,020
看来你的新办法非但不能让她消停会儿
Oh, it doesn't seem that she is redirecting her own energy

183
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:45,530
还让我们浪费了更多电
as much as using a lot of ours.

184
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,980
但你注意到没 她正在逐渐把注意力
But do you see how she's slowly transitioning

185
00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:50,100
从灯光转移到音乐上吗
from the lights to the music?

186
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,760
对 对 我看到了
Yeah. Yeah, I do.

187
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:54,520
轻松得都让我 忘记曾经必须亲自
It's hard to believe there was ever a time

188
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:57,020
费口舌说"住手停下"的时光了
when we just said, "Stop doing that."

189
00:06:59,162 --> 00:07:00,019
天呐 别玩垃圾处理器
Oh. The garbage disposal.

190
00:07:00,019 --> 00:07:01,762
莉莉 不行 不行
Lily, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

191
00:07:01,762 --> 00:07:05,140
不如我们诱导你去睡个小觉吧
Now let's redirect you into a nap, huh?

192
00:07:05,140 --> 00:07:06,660
实际上我们在尝试新办法
Actually, we're doing this new thing

193
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:09,340
孩子想睡觉的时候 让她自己告诉我们
where we let her tell us when she wants to take a nap.

194
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:11,260
这叫"我的睡眠我做主"
It's called "Being your own nap captain."

195
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:14,000
过来 乖女儿
Come on, sweetie.

196
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:21,560
菲尔
Phil.

197
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,560
你按门铃了吗
Did you ring the doorbell?

198
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:26,540
没有 拿着咖啡没腾出手
Oh, no, 'cause I have these two coffees.

199
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:27,280
一杯给你
One is for you.

200
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,200
谢谢
Thank you.

201
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:30,420
我的生活大致如下 一份全职工作
Here's my life-- a full-time job,

202
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:33,080
一个三岁的女儿 还有一个正待领养
a 3-year-old, and a second one on the way.

203
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:34,700
加上为了帮忙
and as a favor,

204
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,940
我答应帮菲尔他们公司做一点事
I agreed to do a little work for Phil's agency.

205
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,480
麻烦就是 我太出色了
The problem is, I'm very good,

206
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:42,440
我做得越好 他们越离不开我
and the more I do, the more they want me.

207
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,320
一些任务我甚至故意晚些交工
I-I even turned in a few assignments late

208
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,260
为了让他们不要对我死缠烂打
so that they'd fall out of love with me a little bit.

209
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:47,840
可不就得这样
Right.

210
00:07:48,252 --> 00:07:49,796
你在门外站了多久了
How--how long have you been standing here?

211
00:07:49,796 --> 00:07:51,528
你没事吧
Are--are you-- are you all right?

212
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:52,080
没事
Oh, yeah.

213
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:53,830
你眼睛怎么眨个不停
'cause you're-- you're really blinking.

214
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,940
我一有压力就眨眼
I'm a stress blinker,

215
00:07:57,940 --> 00:08:01,392
尤其是跟别人对峙的时候
and what really gets me going is confrontation.

216
00:08:01,392 --> 00:08:03,880
很讨厌那感觉 能避免就避免
I hate it. I-I avoid it at all costs.

217
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,700
手足无措
Terrible at it.

218
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:07,380
有一次 我想跟一个女孩提分手
Once, I, uh, I tried to break up with a girl,

219
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:08,820
我绕了好大一个圈子
and I danced around it so much,

220
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:10,920
结果她都不知道我跟她分手了
she didn't know I had broken up with her.

221
00:08:12,113 --> 00:08:14,240
结果我跟她一结婚就是20年
20 years later, we're still married.

222
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:17,220
我 非常 抱歉
I am... Really... Sorry...

223
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:19,760
咖啡都凉了
about the cold coffee.

224
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:21,940
没那么凉 还温[卢克热]着呢
It's not that cold. It's lukewarm, so...

225
00:08:22,955 --> 00:08:24,904
-我得走了 -你用那词让我想到个事儿
- Okay, so-- - Funny story about that expression--

226
00:08:24,904 --> 00:08:27,560
我家娃还小的时候 我们...
when the kids were younger, um, we had a, uh,

227
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,883
有一个嬉水池
a wading pool...

228
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:30,637
间或卢克总捣鼓出点乱子
and occasionally, Luke would have an accident,

229
00:08:30,637 --> 00:08:32,288
然后艾丽克斯就吓得直叫
and, um, Alex would scream,

230
00:08:32,288 --> 00:08:34,380
然后我们就说 亲爱的没事
and we'd say, um, "It's okay, honey,

231
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:36,360
只不过把水"卢克热"一下
he's just making it lukewarm."

232
00:08:39,467 --> 00:08:40,775
-那么 -我得走了
- Wow, so-- - So I gotta get going,

233
00:08:40,775 --> 00:08:42,160
-回头见 -好吧 等一下
- but I-I'll see-- - Okay, wait!

234
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,040
我还是开门见山地说吧
I'm just gonna come straight out and say it.

235
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,940
米奇尔 你在我们公司做得很好
Mitchell, you've done a wonderful job for the agency

236
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:48,280
既然你决定帮我们这个小忙
Since you decided you'd help us out for just a little bit.

237
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,083
而我们也不该再麻烦你 对吧
And we couldn't ask for more, could we?

238
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:52,280
但我不希望合作就此结束
I wish it didn't have to end.

239
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:55,240
如果能由我决定 你可以一直干下去
In fact, if it was up to me, you'd stay on forever...

240
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,554
-菲尔 菲尔 -但我说了不算数 对吧
- Phil, Phil... - But it is not just up to me, is it?

241
00:08:57,602 --> 00:08:59,548
-所以 -菲尔我早知会如此
- So... - I... Phil, I saw this coming,

242
00:08:59,548 --> 00:09:01,455
而且 你看啊
And--and look...

243
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:05,620
我逃了 我找了个借口就跑了
I bailed. I made an excuse and left.

244
00:09:06,067 --> 00:09:08,240
但我必须和他实话实说
But I-I-I've gotta be straight with him.

245
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:10,280
"菲尔 我不能永远帮你们公司干活"
"Phil, I cannot stay on with your firm forever."

246
00:09:10,711 --> 00:09:13,030
天呐 那一定会让他很伤心
Oh! God, it's gonna crush him.

247
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,180
要不让克莱尔帮我传个话
Maybe I can get Claire to do it.

248
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,900
挺简单就说出口了嘛
Well, that was easy!

249
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,760
我们以你为豪
We're really proud of you, buddy.

250
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,873
颁奖典礼上见
See you at the ceremony.

251
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,640
-你不是英雄 -是我把火灭了
- You're not a hero. -I put out a fire.

252
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,600
你自己点的火
A fire you started.

253
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,080
-当时是不是起火了 -是的
- Was there a fire? - Yes.

254
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,310
-火是我灭的吗 -这不
- Did I put it out? - That's not--

255
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,320
你就回答这个问题
Answer the question.

256
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:35,560
是的
Yes.

257
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,440
他们要为此给我发奖
I'm getting an award for it.

258
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,440
如果他们要给纵火的发奖
If they gave awards for starting fires,

259
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,800
我还会再拿一项奖
I'd be getting one of those, too.

260
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,600
卢克 我知道你是个有良心的人
I know you have a conscience, Luke.

261
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:46,280
你看这国旗 它是正义的象征
Do you see this flag? It stands for justice.

262
00:09:46,489 --> 00:09:48,600
等火警部的人来了后
So when that fire marshall gets here,

263
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,020
我知道你会注视着国旗
I know you're going to look at that flag

264
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,247
做正确的事情
and do the right thing.

265
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,580
你回家路上一句话也没说
You were very quiet all the way home.

266
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,920
你不高兴 是不是因为我冲老太太摁喇叭了
Are you upset at me because I honked at that old lady?

267
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:07,040
一般来说 摁喇叭是司机的事
Normally, we leave the honking to the driver,

268
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,140
但我已经习惯了
but I'm used to it.

269
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:09,740
是因为那三明治吗
Is it because of the sandwich?

270
00:10:09,752 --> 00:10:12,309
你其实可以吃掉一大半
Ah, you maybe could have eaten half of it...

271
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,620
然后再美言几句
said a couple of nice things.

272
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:15,449
杰 不就是个三明治嘛
It's just a sandwich, Jay.

273
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:17,720
歌洛莉亚 这不是三明治的问题
It's not about the delicious sandwich, Gloria.

274
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:20,360
而是你尊不尊重他人感受的问题
It's about being respectful of a person's feelings.

275
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,100
但我只是实话实说啊
But I was just being honest.

276
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:23,080
一段感情中并不是每件小事
You don't have to be honest

277
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,540
你都要实话实说告诉另一半的
about every little thing in a relationship.

278
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:27,040
有时该说实话 有时不该说
Some things you say, some things you don't.

279
00:10:27,820 --> 00:10:29,920
有什么事你没说实话
What are the things that you don't say?

280
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,300
歌洛莉亚 我实在不想谈这个
Gloria, I really don't wanna do this anymore.

281
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:31,860
真的吗
Oh, really?

282
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:34,420
可你不能光顾着教训我
But you cannot just try to teach me a lesson,

283
00:10:34,420 --> 00:10:35,360
-却不... -好好
- and then not even.. - Okay, fine.

284
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,360
虽然不想这么说
I don't say this,

285
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:39,040
可有件事确实让我有点烦
But it... Bothers me a little bit

286
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,600
你说话的动静有些许 聒噪
That you're just a tiny bit... loud.

287
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,160
-聒噪 -也不是每时每刻
- Loud? - Not all the time.

288
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,852
只是 在你开口说话时
Only when you, you know, when you talk.

289
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,020
我让你觉得丢人吗
So I embarrass you?

290
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:48,360
-歌洛莉亚 -干嘛
- Gloria... - What?

291
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,400
我说话又太聒噪了吗
Am I being too loud again?

292
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,634
好吧 又有得斗了
All right. Buckle up.

293
00:10:51,634 --> 00:10:54,882
我现在要去洗衣服了
Oh, I'm gonna go and try to do the laundry,

294
00:10:54,882 --> 00:10:56,260
我会蹑手蹑脚轻言轻语地
and I'm gonna do it very quietly

295
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:59,520
不想烦你 或许曼尼能帮我
so I don't bother you. Maybe Manny can help me.

296
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,480
曼尼
Manny!

297
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:03,800
-意思到了就好了 -曼尼
- I get it. - Manny!

298
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,320
我懂了
I get it.

299
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:09,380
现在你一点声都没有了
Now you're not even making any noise.

300
00:11:12,140 --> 00:11:14,540
葡萄放太多了
Okay, this is way too many grapes,

301
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:16,280
而且这勺子不够复古
and this spoon is modern day,

302
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:18,520
如果我们用了 餐桌上的所有人都会惊异于
so if we use it, everyone at the table has to react in shock

303
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,620
这从未来穿越来的勺子
at the spoon from the future.

304
00:11:20,126 --> 00:11:22,400
好吧 这下穿越进下水道了
Okay. And that went down the drain.

305
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:23,540
你赶紧去打个盹吧
And you need a nap.

306
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:25,180
你才要打个盹呢
You need a nap.

307
00:11:25,380 --> 00:11:28,160
我捡到了 又掉了 擦
I got it. Ooh, I lost it. Shoot.

308
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:30,540
需要我帮你减少一些外界干扰吗
Let me know if I can eliminate any distractions for you.

309
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:32,480
捡到了 我手指够到了 快了
Oh, I got it. No, I got a finger on it. There it is.

310
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:33,560
又掉了
Oh, lost it again.

311
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,880
或许你该等它自己出来
Maybe you should just wait until it comes to you.

312
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,280
你懂的 让勺子自己做主嘛
You know, make it the captain of its own spoon platoon.

313
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,680
克莱尔 我知道你想说什么 但是
I understand the point you're making, Claire, but...

314
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:41,740
啊 我被卡出了
Oh! Now I'm stuck.

315
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:42,840
是啊 小卡 你确实卡住了
Yeah, Cam, you are stuck.

316
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:45,320
你卡在了一个根本不管用的方法论上
You are stuck on a philosophy that clearly doesn't work.

317
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:48,080
有时 你必须对孩子说"不"
Sometimes, you need to say "No" to a child.

318
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:50,560
是啊 有时 你也需要对一个大人说"不"
Yeah, and sometimes you need to say "No" to an adult.

319
00:11:50,700 --> 00:11:53,860
不 克莱尔 我不需要别人教我怎么带小孩
No, Claire. No, I don't need help raising my child.

320
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,680
好吧
Oh. Okay.

321
00:11:56,300 --> 00:11:56,760
不好意思
Sorry.

322
00:11:57,054 --> 00:11:58,938
看来 我还有很多要学
Guess I-I do have a lot to learn.

323
00:11:59,729 --> 00:12:02,140
现在 我就想看看
Right now, I-I'm looking forward to learning

324
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:04,040
你能不能及时抽出手来
if you will get your arm out of there

325
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:06,380
别等莉莉打开了水槽垃圾粉碎器的开关
before Lily gets to the garbage disposal switch.

326
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:12,180
莉莉 宝贝儿
Um... Lily, sweetie!

327
00:12:12,190 --> 00:12:13,880
克莱尔 你能帮帮忙吗
C-can you do something, please, Claire?

328
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:15,280
我愿意 真的 我愿意
I would like to. Really, I would,

329
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,440
可我只会说"不"
But I would probably just say "No"

330
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:19,300
那会打击她的自信心和自尊心
and shred her confidence and mangle her self-esteem.

331
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:20,840
好啦 我错了 看这儿
Okay, fine! I'm sorry! Just--here,

332
00:12:20,943 --> 00:12:23,200
-阻止她 阻止她 宝贝 -看你怎么办
- Stop her! Stop her! Sweetie! - What to do with you?

333
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:24,320
克莱尔 好吧
Claire! Okay!

334
00:12:29,522 --> 00:12:30,454
真好玩
Ohh! Yes!

335
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,469
-你觉得这很好玩是吧 -当然了
- You think that's funny, don't ya? - Oh, sure.

336
00:12:37,469 --> 00:12:39,660
太坏了 克莱尔 你太坏了
Yes. Well, it's wicked, Claire. It's wicked.

337
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,720
过来 我们该走了 莉莉
Come on. We're leaving, lily!

338
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:41,740
莉莉
Lily!

339
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:43,440
简直就是行为艺术
It's living art.

340
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:46,140
整整90秒我们就笔直站在那
We stay perfectly still for 90 seconds,

341
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:47,240
几乎纹丝不动
basically doing nothing.

342
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,520
我第一个老婆在床上也一动不动
Sounds like my first wife.

343
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:50,700
不是吧 她在我身上动得可欢呢
I don't know. She always moved for me.

344
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,760
你们都承认只能坚持90秒就行了
As long as you both agree it was only 90 seconds.

345
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:54,640
一石在手 二傻出糗
Two nerds with one stone!

346
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:56,460
我就爱在办公室里工作
I love working in an office.

347
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,760
那是你小舅子吗 你不是把他解雇了吗
Is that your brother-in-law? I thought you fired him.

348
00:12:58,820 --> 00:13:00,320
是啊 上班路上
I did, before work.

349
00:13:00,333 --> 00:13:01,560
那他在这儿干嘛
Then what's he doing here?

350
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,220
愤愤不平吗 他看起来是有点
Is he disgruntled? He looks disgruntled.

351
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,660
不 他生下来就这德性
No, he always looks like that.

352
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,520
有事吗
Hey. How's it going?

353
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:08,740
听着
Hey, hey. Listen--

354
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:10,560
我知道这很尴尬
Okay, I know this is uncomfortable...

355
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:13,120
但我们需要谈谈我在这里的前景
but we really need to talk about my future here.

356
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,700
但我 我以为我们
But I-I-I thought we--

357
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,540
不 我知道我让你误以为
No, I know. I know I led you to believe

358
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:18,260
我能一直在这里工作下去
that I'd be able to stay on here indefinitely,

359
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:19,634
而且
And--and... O-okay,

360
00:13:19,634 --> 00:13:20,625
别眨眼了
Don't get all blinky. Oh.

361
00:13:20,635 --> 00:13:23,020
-也不全是坏消息 -好吧
- No, it's not all bad news, okay? - Okay.

362
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:25,040
就按我们商量好的 我会待到七月
You will have me until July, like we agreed.

363
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,520
-挺好 -对
- Okay, great. - Yes.

364
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,340
你能麻溜儿地跟我坐电梯下去一趟吗
Hey, could you jump on the elevator with me real quick?

365
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:30,704
-行 -要麻烦你帮我从车里搬点东西上来
- Yes. - Yes. I could use a hand carrying up some stuff from my car.

366
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:35,160
对了 要先拿点空箱子 对吗
Oh! My goodness. I probably need some empty boxes, don't I?

367
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:36,600
要不你先下去
You know what? You head down,

368
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,760
我们在玻璃门那儿会合
I'll meet you at the glass doors.

369
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:38,840
我还想说什么来着 是什么呢
There was something else. What was it?

370
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,178
就在脑边了 对了 你被炒了
I know it's in there. Oh, yeah, you're fired.

371
00:13:40,178 --> 00:13:42,395
什么 被炒了
What? F-fired?!

372
00:13:43,703 --> 00:13:45,390
这门怎么了这是
W-what's going on with these things?

373
00:13:46,738 --> 00:13:47,587
你在帮忙打开吗
You trying to open 'em?

374
00:13:48,745 --> 00:13:50,722
我想我最好去叫些帮手
I guess I better... get somebody.

375
00:13:50,722 --> 00:13:51,960
等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait--

376
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,960
你干嘛要炒我
You're firing me?

377
00:13:53,173 --> 00:13:54,920
我压根就不喜欢这份工作啊
I-I don't even like this job.

378
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:55,820
这样不安全
That can't be safe.

379
00:13:55,903 --> 00:13:58,360
-有人被困在里面了吗 -被炒的那个人
- Is someone trapped in there? - The guy they fired.

380
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,420
那个懒货吗
Oh, the lazy guy?

381
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,160
懒货?
Lazy?!

382
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:01,800
你迟交过一些材料
You handed in a couple of things late.

383
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:02,640
我该事先给你提个醒的
I should have warned you.

384
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,500
我不擅长告诉别人坏消息
I'm terrible at breaking bad news.

385
00:14:04,660 --> 00:14:05,980
那你为什么要跑到我家
Well, then why did you come over to my house

386
00:14:05,980 --> 00:14:07,180
把我吹得跟朵花似的
and tell me how great I was?

387
00:14:07,220 --> 00:14:08,660
我那是想炒你鱿鱼
That was me trying to fire you!

388
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,580
上次这么纠结还是20年前
I haven't felt like this since I tried to

389
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:12,120
我打算跟克莱尔闹分手
break up with Claire 20 years ago.

390
00:14:12,132 --> 00:14:13,260
又有人困在里面了吗
Someone's stuck again?

391
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:15,080
他们刚炒掉的那个态度恶劣的律师
That lawyer with the attitude they just fired.

392
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,520
人都说是因为你态度恶劣
They said it was your attitude,

393
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:18,620
摆着谱像是给了我们多大恩惠
like you were doing us a favor.

394
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,700
难道不是这样吗
I was doing you a favor!

395
00:14:20,700 --> 00:14:23,167
-他干了什么了这么遭人恨 -偷懒
- Why didn't he get the service like everyone else? - Lazy

396
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,460
别担心 他打不着你
Don't worry. He can't get you.

397
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,080
我在里面困了两个小时
Two hours I was stuck in there

398
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,077
整个办公室的人都来围观
with the entire office of people staring at me,

399
00:14:31,077 --> 00:14:33,907
我 我最后只好躺下
I-I finally had to lie down.

400
00:14:35,675 --> 00:14:37,309
让我的形象更加恶劣
doesn't help my reputation

401
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,020
瞧这熊样
Figures.

402
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:55,800
你们干的棒极了
You guys nailed it.

403
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,000
小兄弟 神乎其神的
Dude, that was surreal.

404
00:14:57,405 --> 00:14:58,920
老爸 拜托
Dad, come on!

405
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,740
我们还剩一分钟准备时间
We have a minute to set up!

406
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,600
米奇尔和小卡在哪里
Where are Mitchell and Cam?

407
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:05,560
曼尼 谢谢你之前那些关于国旗的演说
Hey, Manny. Thanks for what you said before about the flag.

408
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,740
真的让我思绪良多
It really got me thinking.

409
00:15:06,740 --> 00:15:08,227
我知道你是有良知的 卢克
I knew you had a conscience, Luke.

410
00:15:08,227 --> 00:15:10,553
更重要的是 你有一颗好...
And more importantly, you've got a good...

411
00:15:10,957 --> 00:15:11,860
你不是吧
You didn't.

412
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:13,260
没错 多亏了你
Yep. And thanks to you,

413
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,660
我让他们移师国旗下完成了仪式
I had them move the ceremony to right under the flag.

414
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,240
我会给你张签名照的
I'll sign a picture for you.

415
00:15:19,780 --> 00:15:21,440
你们来了 就怕你们放我鸽子
Oh, there you are. I was afraid you weren't coming.

416
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:22,400
是商量着要不要来的
It was a discussion.

417
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,640
如果我们决定不来
If we weren't gonna show up,

418
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,560
我们肯定会提前告诉你
we would have clearly let you know,

419
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,160
而不是在公共场合羞辱你
and not humiliated you in public.

420
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,280
权当是安慰吧
If it's any consolation,

421
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:29,640
我们新雇的律师
the lawyer we hired to replace you

422
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,180
已经对那个电梯公司发起诉讼了
is already suing the elevator company.

423
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,700
你坐到我手上了
You're sitting on my hand.

424
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:33,700
好歹你双手都在
Be thankful you have two.

425
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:34,760
我今天可差点废掉一只
I almost lost one today.

426
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:35,940
别像个孩子似的
Oh, stop being such a baby.

427
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,100
她离那个开关十万八千里呢
She was nowhere near that switch.

428
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:39,480
安静点 我们要开始了
shh! Keep your voices down.We're about to go on.

429
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:40,480
你看着我干什么
Why you looking at me?

430
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,020
我很聒噪吗 大家都这么认为吗
Am I too loud? Is that what everybody thinks?

431
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:44,540
-怎么了 -她这是事出有因
- What? - There's a backstory here

432
00:15:44,547 --> 00:15:45,320
我就不折磨你们耳朵了
you don't wanna know about.

433
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:47,860
-我想要火鸡 -忍着 小甜心
- I want turkey. - Save your appetite, baby girl.

434
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:48,980
别忘了 结束后
And don't forget, afterwards,

435
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:50,420
我们要去"连记餐馆"吃个简餐
we're going to Lenny's for a bite to eat--

436
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:52,240
如果在乎我 到时候就多吃点
more than a bite if you value my feelings.

437
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,740
太好了 我们能看到玛克辛了
Oh! Great, we get to see Maxine.

438
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:55,680
什么 你也知道玛克辛吗
What? You know Maxine, too?

439
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:57,320
-我们都知道玛克辛 -超爱的
- Oh, we all know Maxine. - Love.

440
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:58,720
她有这世上第二棒的拥抱
Second-best hugger in the world,

441
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:01,200
仅次于伯特·雷诺兹 说来话长
after Mr. Burt Reynolds. Story to follow.

442
00:16:01,212 --> 00:16:03,440
好了 90秒后就大功告成了
All right, guys, this will all be over in 90 seconds.

443
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,760
-姿势都给我定好 -好
- Hold your poses. - Okay.

444
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:06,416
我想给"迷死人"老师留个好印象
I really wanna impress Mr. Gorgeous.

445
00:16:07,128 --> 00:16:08,398
是贾维斯老师 闭嘴
Jarvis! Shut up.

446
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:11,060
米奇 我知道现在说这个不合适
Hey, Mitch, I know this isn't a good time,

447
00:16:11,060 --> 00:16:12,511
我只是想要你知道
I-I just want you to know,

448
00:16:12,711 --> 00:16:14,740
-我真的 -我知道 菲尔 你很抱歉
- I'm really-- - I know, Phil.You're really sorry, okay?

449
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:16,840
但我需要一点时间平复心情 好吗
But this is gonna take me a little time to get over, all right?

450
00:16:16,949 --> 00:16:19,480
事实上 我是想让你把公司停车卡还我
Actually, I was gonna say I'm really gonna need your parking pass.

451
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:19,860
什么
What?!

452
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:23,600
下一个舞台演出是由艾丽克斯·邓菲带来的
Our next stage presentation will be Alex Dunphy's interpretation

453
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,020
对诺曼·洛克威尔1943年的作品
of Norman Rockwell's 1943 painting,

454
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:26,760
《免于匮乏的自由》的解读
"Freedom from want"

455
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,740
你晚上怎么能安心睡觉 卢克
How do you sleep at night, Luke?

456
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,100
把奖牌挂我脖子上呗
With a medal around my neck.

457
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:33,580
-我想吃火鸡 -莉莉 不要
- I want turkey. - Lily, no!

458
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:34,800
她应该不懂这个词吧
She doesn't understand that word.

459
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,020
收声 克莱尔
Cram it, Claire.

460
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:37,380
管好你的孩子 小卡
Control your child, Cam.

461
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:39,460
又不是啥难事 我养了三个呢
It's not that difficult. I've raised three.

462
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:40,240
-真的吗 -小卡
- Really? - Cam!

463
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:42,640
你为什么不问问海莉昨晚几点回的家
Why don't you ask Haley what time she got home last night?

464
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,380
小卡舅夫
Uncle Cam!

465
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,720
对不起亲爱的 伤及无辜了
Sorry, dear. Collateral damage.

466
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,720
他这是在说什么呢
What is he talking about?

467
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:47,060
你的手臂在抖
Your arms are shaking.

468
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:47,740
怎么着
Oh, yeah,

469
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:50,719
那完美无缺的玛克辛肯定比我做得好
I'm sure that the great Maxine can do a better job!

470
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,760
随便你怎么批判我的教育方式 小卡
You can criticize my parenting all you like, Cam,

471
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:54,600
但我儿子刚得了枚奖牌
but my son just won a medal.

472
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,000
那火是他自己放的
For a fire he started.

473
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,040
卢克 是真的吗
Luke, is that true?

474
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:00,820
还要多久 我快撑不住了
How long? It's getting heavy!

475
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:02,480
那停车卡你是别指望拿回去了
You're not getting that parking pass back.

476
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:03,760
我试过委婉地告诉你
I tried to let you down easy.

477
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:05,260
你不懂得如何与人交流 菲尔
You don't know how to talk to people, Phil.

478
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:07,660
比如克莱尔当时完全不知道你把她甩了
It's just like when Claire didn't even know you dumped her.

479
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:09,220
-什么 -爸爸什么时候甩过你
- What? - When did dad dump you?

480
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:11,152
我没甩她 只是想甩而已
I didn't dump her! I just tried to!

481
00:17:11,152 --> 00:17:12,780
撑不住啦
I am losing it!

482
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:13,940
再坚持几秒种
Just a few more seconds!

483
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,240
我要吃火鸡
I want turkey.

484
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:18,112
莉莉 不
Lily, no!

485
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:21,480
我们真的在尝试少提这个字眼
We really are trying to not say that word.

486
00:17:22,132 --> 00:17:23,121
B-
B-minus,

487
00:17:23,660 --> 00:17:24,840
不过聊以慰藉的是
But there was a silver lining.

488
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:28,320
"我看好你哦 艾丽克斯"
"I expected more, Alex."

489
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:30,780
艾丽克斯[总算叫对名字了]
Alex!

490
00:17:31,731 --> 00:17:33,708
我打电话给海莉告诉她
I am gonna call Haley and tell her

491
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,560
我们不去"连记"吃了
we're not going to that deli.

492
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:36,200
我实在受不了小卡了
I can't take another minute of Cam.

493
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,380
虽然我自己都不太确信
You know, I'm not even sure

494
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:39,160
能被这套全新的家教理论说服
I believe all these new parenting theories,

495
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,980
但让她来对我指手画脚 让我死了算了
but I'll be damned if I'm gonna let her tell me they're wrong.

496
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,740
晚饭我看还是免了吧
We are not going to dinner.

497
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,020
我试过那个三明治了
I tried that sandwich.

498
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:47,280
就那么回事 你不吃也没事
It's not that good. You're not missing anything.

499
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:49,520
我才不稀罕卢克和他的傻帽奖牌
I sure won't miss seeing Luke and that stupid medal.

500
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,820
可我向来循规蹈矩 怎么不给我个奖牌
I play by the rules. Where's my medal?

501
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:53,700
杰可以和那个玛克辛一起吃
Jay can stay with that Maxine.

502
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:55,560
她可没我这么聒噪
She's not loud like me.

503
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:59,320
凭心而论 你给人支招时常常不过脑
In fairness, you can be a little quick to give advice.

504
00:17:59,842 --> 00:18:01,140
我向来一心帮助他人
Well, I'm always ready to help,

505
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:02,340
如果你是这意思的话 那没错
if that's what you mean, yeah.

506
00:18:02,740 --> 00:18:05,020
但如果你不注意下措词 听起来就有点
Yeah, but if you're not careful, it can come off a little...

507
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:07,280
"自以为知"
Know-it-all-y.

508
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,580
这是哪国语言
That's not a word.

509
00:18:09,020 --> 00:18:10,040
你想说的应该是
What you mean to say is,

510
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:12,460
听起来会让人觉得有点"自以为是"
it can come off like I know it all.

511
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:14,760
我一直就是这个做派
I've always been this way.

512
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:16,440
所以当时我才想甩了你
That's why I wanted to break up with you.

513
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:19,220
说"炒掉"这个词根本不合适
The word "Fired" doesn't even apply.

514
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:21,040
帮忙而已 怎么能被炒掉呢
You can't get fired from a favor.

515
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:23,340
好了 亲爱的 你还是别去想了
Okay, sweetie, maybe you should just let it go.

516
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:25,900
就像我常说的 耿耿于怀不如放手释怀
Like I always say, it's better to carry a tune than a grudge.

517
00:18:25,910 --> 00:18:28,240
好吧 你从来没说过这话
Okay, you... you've never said that, but...

518
00:18:28,361 --> 00:18:30,670
那你对克莱尔的耿耿于怀又怎么说
And--and what about this grudge you're holding against Claire?

519
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:32,460
也没见你放手释怀啊
I don't see you trading that in for a tune.

520
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:33,740
那完全不是一回事
That is completely different.

521
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:35,480
她诋毁了我为人父母的能力
She insulted my parenting skills.

522
00:18:35,540 --> 00:18:38,020
你就承认吧 有时候你是老虎屁股摸不得
Which, you have to admit, you can be pretty defensive about.

523
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:42,760
好吧 也许我俩都过于敏感了
Okay, so maybe we both can be a little sensitive.

524
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,381
不 不是
N-no. No.

525
00:18:44,381 --> 00:18:47,000
不 那完全不是同一回事
No. These--these are-- these are not equal.

526
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,920
你完全不了解被炒掉是什么感觉
No, you have no idea what it feels like to be fired.

527
00:18:49,260 --> 00:18:51,480
我了解 我被炒过 谁没有啊
Yes, I do. I've been fired. Everyone has.

528
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,680
我没有
Not me.

529
00:18:53,215 --> 00:18:54,465
-从来没有? -没有
- Never? - No.

530
00:18:54,620 --> 00:18:57,760
没有 我在工作上向来很优秀
Nope, I've always been very good at what I do.

531
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,920
也许你只是第一次
So then maybe what you're feeling

532
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,560
对你的工作产生了一点危机感
is a little insecure about your work for the first time.

533
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:05,720
纯属废话[猪食]
That's hogwash.

534
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:07,880
作为真正见识过猪食的人
As someone who's seen actual hogwash,

535
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,500
我可以保证还没到那份上
I can assure you that it's not.

536
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:12,180
我不理解为什么玛克辛这么招你烦
I don't know why you're so bothered by Maxine.

537
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:13,300
她人不错啊
She's nice.

538
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:16,100
好啊 那不如你 杰还有玛克辛
Oh, good! Why don't you, Jay, and Maxine

539
00:19:16,100 --> 00:19:18,240
一起生活吧 快乐地吃着三明治直到永远
live together, eating sandwiches forever?!

540
00:19:19,474 --> 00:19:21,350
小哥斗胆给你把把脉 老妈
Can I float a theory here, mom?

541
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:22,740
你好像是吃醋了
You sound like you're jealous.

542
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:23,960
得了吧
Please!

543
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,520
我吃那个女人的醋
Me jealous of that woman?

544
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:29,800
我就是看不顺眼他们讲话的样子
I just don't like the way they talk to each other!

545
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,160
还有那私房笑话
And the little jokes,

546
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:34,000
她对他的生活了如指掌
and she knows everything about his life!

547
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:36,130
就是让我感觉
Just makes me feel like, em...

548
00:19:39,560 --> 00:19:40,760
这是吃醋吗
Is that jealous?

549
00:19:42,974 --> 00:19:45,748
我的妈呀
Ay, my poor sisters.

550
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:51,660
就你吗 我以为你们全家人都会来呢
Just you? I thought the whole family was swinging by.

551
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:52,520
谁知道是怎么回事
Who knows what they're doing?

552
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:54,200
现在都看彼此不顺眼
Right now, they're all sniping at each other.

553
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,420
谁需要他们啊
Ah, who needs 'em?

554
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:56,740
是啊 只要我还有你 玛克辛
Right. As long as I have you, Maxine...

555
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:57,800
我五点就下班
I'm off in five.

556
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:58,880
卢克
Hey, Luke!

557
00:19:59,260 --> 00:20:00,700
这亮闪闪的奖牌是什么呀
What's with all the hardware?

558
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:03,940
他在学校制造了火灾 并且撒了谎
Well, he set fire to a school and lied about it.

559
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:05,680
这年头屁大点事也要发个奖牌
You know they give medals for anything these days.

560
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:06,680
明天要还回学校
It's going back tomorrow.

561
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,720
他没什么机会能得奖牌
He doesn't get a lot of medals.

562
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,800
我真的需要来一个"爱的抱抱"
I just really need one of these.

563
00:20:12,701 --> 00:20:14,933
使劲抱吧
Don't hold back. Oh!

564
00:20:14,933 --> 00:20:16,684
宝贝外孙女来了
My girls. There they are. Hi.

565
00:20:16,684 --> 00:20:18,308
大家好啊 好啊
Hello, hello. Hi, all.

566
00:20:18,308 --> 00:20:20,289
小卡
Hey, Cam. Hey!

567
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:23,780
快来
Come on in!

568
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:28,640
你能来太好了
I, uh, I appreciate your coming.

569
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:32,040
还有 我真的真的 谢谢
And, again, I really, really--Thank you.

570
00:20:32,144 --> 00:20:34,320
-她来了 -看谁来了
- There she is. - Well, look who made it.

571
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:36,380
你好 玛克辛 见到你很高兴
Hola, Maxine. So nice to see you.

572
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,880
我去给你们拿菜单
Let me get you some menus.

573
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:38,900
不需要
We don't need it.

574
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:40,838
都要"杰·普里契特"三明治
It's Jay Pritchetts all around!

575
00:20:43,119 --> 00:20:45,360
歌洛莉亚 如果你的三明治不要凤尾鱼
Gloria, if you want your sandwich without anchovies,

576
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:46,200
我不会生气的
I won't be offended.

577
00:20:47,404 --> 00:20:49,316
不过这就要改名为"杰克·菲德曼"了
Of course, then it'll be a Jack Feldman.

578
00:20:59,540 --> 00:21:00,980
-兄弟 -修电梯的来了吗
- Hey, man. - Is the repair guy here?

579
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,080
在修了
He's working on it.

580
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,640
听我说
Um, listen, uh,

581
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:05,240
今天是卡蒂的生日 司格普的助理
It's Katie's birthday, Skip's assistant.

582
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:07,380
30好几了 大龄剩女
Big 3-0. Still no ring.

583
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,640
你叫醒我就为说这个吗
You woke me up to tell me that?

584
00:21:08,652 --> 00:21:10,640
不是 我给你拿了点蛋糕
No, no. I-I grabbed you some cake.

585
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,160
确定不是员工也可以吃吗
Oh, sure it's not for employees only?

586
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:13,760
好吧 就知道会这样
Okay. Had that coming.

587
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:15,080
你跟谁说话呢 菲尔
Who are you talking to, Phil?

588
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:16,360
-米奇尔 -谁
- Mitchell. - Who?

589
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:18,800
米奇尔 我的小舅... 那懒鬼
Mitchell, my br-- uh, the lazy guy.

590
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:20,600
我只是来帮你忙而已
I was doing you a favor.

591
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:23,000
好吧 蛋糕给我 我饿了
All right, just give me the cake. I'm hungry.

592
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:24,700
不要啊
No!
